---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact Fullfill | Wellness & Mental Fitness App"
  description="Contact Fullfill about our wellness and mental fitness app, AI journal, emotional fitness tools, stress relief, personal growth, and corporate memberships."
  keywords="Fullfill contact, wellness app, mental fitness, emotional fitness, AI journal, stress relief app, personal growth, corporate wellness"
  canonicalPath="/contact/"
>
  <section class="contact-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Get in Touch</h1>
      <p class="intro-text">Have questions about Fullfill, our wellness and mental fitness app, or our corporate memberships? We'd love to hear from you.</p>

      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <h3>Email</h3>
          <p>For general inquiries and support:</p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <h3>Business Inquiries</h3>
          <p>For corporate partnerships and business opportunities:</p>
          <a href="mailto:business@fullfill.me">business@fullfill.me</a>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <h3>Social Media</h3>
          <p>Connect with us on social platforms:</p>
          <div class="social-links">
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1HCWzt8tce" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/fullfill.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-form-section">
        <h2>Send us a Message</h2>
        <p>Tell us how we can help. Your message is protected against automated spam.</p>

        <form
          name="contact"
          method="POST"
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-recaptcha="true"
          netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          class="contact-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
          <p class="hidden-field">
            <label>Don’t fill this out if you’re human: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
          </p>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name">Your Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">Your Email *</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="subject">Subject *</label>
            <input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Message *</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <div data-netlify-recaptcha="true"></div>
          <button type="submit" class="submit-button">Send Message</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-section">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is Fullfill?</h3><p>Fullfill is a wellness and personal growth platform offering journaling, breathing exercises, goal optimization, and AI-powered insights to help you build clarity, purpose, and inner fire.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>How do I get started?</h3><p>Download the Fullfill app, create an account, and start building healthier habits for your mind and wellbeing.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Is my data private?</h3><p>Privacy is a core priority. Your personal reflections and journal content are not used for third-party advertising.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>How can I become a contributor?</h3><p>Visit our <a href="/contribute/">Contribute page</a> to learn how you can share wellness content and expertise with the Fullfill community.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Do you offer corporate memberships?</h3><p>Yes. Visit our <a href="/corporate/">Corporate Memberships page</a> to learn more about workplace wellness and corporate programs.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-section { max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:60px 20px; }
  .container { width:100%; }
  h1 { font-size:2.5rem; margin-bottom:20px; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); }
  .intro-text { font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:50px; color:var(--text-secondary,#666); }
  .contact-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:30px; margin-bottom:60px; }
  .contact-card { padding:30px; border:1px solid var(--border-color,#e0e0e0); border-radius:8px; background:var(--card-bg,#fafafa); text-align:center; }
  .contact-card h3 { font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:15px; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); }
  .contact-card p { font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:15px; color:var(--text-color,#333); }
  .contact-card a { display:inline-block; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; }
  .contact-card a:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
  .social-links { display:flex; gap:15px; justify-content:center; }
  .contact-form-section { background:var(--card-bg,#fafafa); padding:50px 40px; border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:60px; }
  .contact-form-section h2 { font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:10px; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); }
  .contact-form-section > p { margin-bottom:30px; color:var(--text-secondary,#666); }
  .contact-form { max-width:600px; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom:25px; }
  .form-group label { display:block; margin-bottom:8px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); }
  .form-group input,.form-group textarea { width:100%; padding:12px; border:1px solid var(--border-color,#ddd); border-radius:6px; font-size:1rem; font-family:inherit; }
  .form-group input:focus,.form-group textarea:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(63,94,240,.1); }
  .submit-button { padding:14px 40px; margin-top:20px; background:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); color:white; border:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; font-size:1rem; }
  .hidden-field { position:absolute; left:-9999px; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden; }
  .faq-section { margin-top:60px; }
  .faq-section h2 { font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:30px; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); }
  .faq-item { margin-bottom:30px; padding-bottom:30px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#e0e0e0); }
  .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .faq-item h3 { font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:10px; color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); }
  .faq-item p { font-size:1rem; line-height:1.6; color:var(--text-color,#333); }
  .faq-item a { color:var(--primary-color,#3f5ef0); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; }
  @media(max-width:768px){ .contact-section{padding:40px 15px;} h1{font-size:1.8rem;} .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .contact-form-section{padding:30px 20px;} .social-links{flex-direction:column;} }
</style>
